<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/doi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Digital Object Identifier (DOI)](https://www.doi.org/the-identifier/what-is-a-doi/) is a unique, [ISO 26324](https://www.iso.org/standard/88862.html)-standardized identifier for physical, digital, or abstract objects, formatted as a prefix and suffix separated by a forward slash (e.g., `10.1000/182`)."@en .
_:N354d2e8022ca4a8893725b587fb50fd6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/support> .
